<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Altoona, Iowa, GO bond issues.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Altoona, Iowa, GO bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it qualified for insurance a $2.4 million GO issue and a $3.7 million GO issue for Altoona, Iowa, slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
